    "preamble": "M.Selvaraj vs Ramesh Babu on 9 May, 2025 Before The Madurai Bench Of Madras High Court Dated : 09.05.2025 Coram: The Honourable Mr.Justice P.B.Balaji Cont.P.(MD) No.1350 of 2025 M.Selvaraj Vs. Ramesh Babu Designated Officer, Tamil Nadu Food safety and Drug Administration Department, Food Safety Wing, Race course Road, Tiruchirapalli. .. Respondent Prayer:",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "The learned counsel for the petitioner fairly submits that after the listing of the contempt petition, the order of this Court, dated 15.04.2025 has been complied with by the respondents. The learned counsel for the petitioner would however submit that there is a delay of 8 days and hence, the Court should admonish the respondent for the delay and impose cost.",
